日式咖哩，整體不難吃但價格略高，店內氣氛不錯，有自取冰塊。\n\n點了三拼、唐揚雞、炸魚排。\n\n唐揚雞不錯，份量不少，重口味。\n\n三拼還行，雞肉嫩但無調味，配上重口味的咖哩醬算是剛好，牛肉偏鹹。\n\n魚排不推，雖然香酥但偏油，肉量少而且調味後吃不出是什麼魚。\n\n對我來說最扣分的是料理不夠熱，除了炸魚排以外，其他東西包括咖哩醬最多都是溫熱而已，有些配菜甚至是冷的。然後咖哩中的馬鈴薯和紅蘿蔔只有各一塊好少...",null,[0,44]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12164867889948794772/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlpjWEJmYVZsUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12164867889948794772/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlpjWEJmYVZsUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12164867889948794772/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlpjWEJmYVZsUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12164867889948794772/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlpjWEJmYVZsUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12164867889948794772/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlpjWEJmYVZsUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12164867889948794772/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTlpjWEJmYVZsUkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,13927,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNZcXBfaVlREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xeec4095019733b3f!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCYqp_iYQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNZcXBfaVlREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNZcXBfaVlREi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdNQ1lxcF9pNFFFEhNDZ3dJeklEWXdBWVF1UGpZeEFFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdNQ1lxcF9pRVESE0Nnd0l6SURZd0FZUXVQall4QUUiEgkAAAAAAAAAABE_O3MZUAnE7ioLMGM0VjBCTl9Za3M\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjthdyoydKWAxXGdfUHHbRlLPUQoykIzQEoBg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiYkuOoydKWAxVPdV4EHV-rI_4Q0pMFCHooBQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjthdyoydKWAxXGdfUHHbRlLPUQ0pMFCMQBKAU"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNCZ2M3N2l3RRAB",["0x0:0xeec4095019733b3f",null,1672138659922475,16